      "verified_by": "required.coverage_ctor_aliases_closure_coverage",
      "fine_trace_step": 2,
      "description": "The vulnerable helper takes the Coverage object from `this+coverage` by value and initializes `Coverage::Iter` from constructor-local copy `t1`. On the staged witness that copied Coverage has format 1, so `Coverage::Iter::init` calls `CoverageFormat1::Iter::init`, which stores `c = &c_` into the copied `CoverageFormat1` inside `t1`; when the constructor returns, `iter` retains pointer state derived from expired stack storage."
